message: "If you use Super Work in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Super Work: A Local-First Multi-Model Orchestration Workbench"
abstract: "Super Work is an open-source, local-first workbench that orchestrates multiple large language models into parallel, coordinated, and conversational workflows, with artifact delivery and a physically accurate real-time Earth visualization."
